&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT NEXGEN CLOUD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NexGen Cloud is a fast-growing GPU cloud and AI infrastructure business. We&#39;re the company behind Hyperstack — a self-serve, on-demand cloud platform built for high-performance AI, HPC, and compute-heavy workloads. Powered by 100% renewable energy and NVIDIA architecture, Hyperstack gives teams from AI startups to enterprise the compute they need, without the cost or complexity of legacy cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, solve hard problems, and build things that matter. If you want ownership, real impact, and a front-row seat to one of the most consequential infrastructure shifts of the decade — this is the place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE: Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NexGen Cloud is moving to a data-driven way of running the business. Right now, revenue, occupancy, billing and pipeline data live across data warehouses, business systems and APIs, and the numbers don&#39;t always agree. We&#39;re building out our Strategic Finance team so that leadership, sales and operations can rely on one set of figures and act on them daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits someone who enjoys the technical craft of data and wants to learn the commercial side of the AI compute market. We&#39;ll teach you that context. When a number looks wrong, you&#39;ll dig until you find why, and you&#39;ll come back with a fix as well as the problem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BE DOING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rather than a checklist, here&#39;s what success in this role actually looks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the pipelines that bring data from across the business into Databricks and Power BI, and automate the manual steps along the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the daily revenue and occupancy reporting that leadership uses to track how the GPU fleet is performing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check that what we bill matches what customers actually used, covering power draw, utilisation, asset registers and credits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support commission calculations and give sales leadership a clear view of pipeline health, conversion and churn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model pricing options and deal economics so investment decisions are grounded in real numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate every figure before it reaches leadership or anyone outside the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the wider team work confidently with BI tools and data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care more about how you think and work than a perfect CV. You&#39;ll likely bring a combination of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience as a Data Analyst or in a similar role, including data extraction, integration or automation projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and Excel skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid Power BI experience, including reconciling figures when different sources disagree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on use of a CRM (HubSpot or similar), and of AI tools to speed up analysis and build work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A root-cause mindset: you find the underlying cause rather than reporting the symptom, and you bring a proposed solution with it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to billing, revenue assurance or commission processes, ideally in a cloud, SaaS or usage-based business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience with financial modelling or FP&amp;amp;A work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time spent in a high-growth company where data processes were still being built&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and annual discretionary bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee wellbeing benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday, plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements (remote or hybrid, depending on role and location)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership and autonomy — the trust to take initiative and experiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visible, meaningful impact as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear career progression in a high-growth company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, international culture built on trust, transparency, and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to help shape NexGen Cloud&#39;s team, culture, and future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY APPLY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from all backgrounds. If you enjoy solving complex infrastructure problems and want to build something meaningful at scale, we&#39;d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
